    "detailed_description": "Open your own gun center! In this amazing simulator, you can earn a lot of money and learn the secrets of different weapons. Immerse yourself in the world of guns and watch your business grow, attracting different types of customers - whether they are hobbyists, hunters or professional security guards.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/647d3f4421952fdada4cdd0a3975bfc7.poster.avif?t=1753731722\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/647d3f4421952fdada4cdd0a3975bfc7.webm?t=1753731722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/647d3f4421952fdada4cdd0a3975bfc7.mp4?t=1753731722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run your own gun business</h2>Organize your inventory with precision, making sure that everything from pistols to assault rifles is displayed to attract customers. As your center grows, so will your customer base, leading to a bustling business filled with both casual buyers and serious collectors<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/00c2827b073d2cb964a94d1b7a2620b8.poster.avif?t=1753731722\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/00c2827b073d2cb964a94d1b7a2620b8.webm?t=1753731722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/00c2827b073d2cb964a94d1b7a2620b8.mp4?t=1753731722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shooting range</h2>In addition to selling weapons, Gun Center Simulator offers a fully equipped shooting range where you can test your weapons. Test any firearm from your collection. Whether you're testing a finely tuned sniper rifle or checking how a pistol works, the shooting range is the ultimate playground for gun lovers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/7012b05c5e71b3a132bd9d9253ee9f4e.poster.avif?t=1753731722\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/7012b05c5e71b3a132bd9d9253ee9f4e.webm?t=1753731722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/7012b05c5e71b3a132bd9d9253ee9f4e.mp4?t=1753731722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design and develop</h2>Your store is more than just a business \u2013 it\u2019s a reflection of your style and success. As you generate more revenue, reinvest it into expanding and improving your center. Designed store with organized gun racks, the d\u00e9cor will attract more traffic and increase your sales.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/05858cf3872aba7511a731eb665ee163.poster.avif?t=1753731722\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/05858cf3872aba7511a731eb665ee163.webm?t=1753731722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/05858cf3872aba7511a731eb665ee163.mp4?t=1753731722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Are you ready to become the best gun dealer? Whether you sell firearms to the public, cater to die-hard collectors, or test your skills on the shooting range, Gun Center Simulator is your ticket to success in the competitive world of the gun trade. Take on the role of an owner and experience the thrill of building a gun center empire!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/c9a6d211014b5d97e00864dc3e534331.poster.avif?t=1753731722\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/c9a6d211014b5d97e00864dc3e534331.webm?t=1753731722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/c9a6d211014b5d97e00864dc3e534331.mp4?t=1753731722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Open your own gun center! In this amazing simulator, you can earn a lot of money and learn the secrets of different weapons. Immerse yourself in the world of guns and watch your business grow, attracting different types of customers - whether they are hobbyists, hunters or professional security guards.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/647d3f4421952fdada4cdd0a3975bfc7.poster.avif?t=1753731722\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/647d3f4421952fdada4cdd0a3975bfc7.webm?t=1753731722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/647d3f4421952fdada4cdd0a3975bfc7.mp4?t=1753731722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run your own gun business</h2>Organize your inventory with precision, making sure that everything from pistols to assault rifles is displayed to attract customers. As your center grows, so will your customer base, leading to a bustling business filled with both casual buyers and serious collectors<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/00c2827b073d2cb964a94d1b7a2620b8.poster.avif?t=1753731722\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/00c2827b073d2cb964a94d1b7a2620b8.webm?t=1753731722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/00c2827b073d2cb964a94d1b7a2620b8.mp4?t=1753731722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shooting range</h2>In addition to selling weapons, Gun Center Simulator offers a fully equipped shooting range where you can test your weapons. Test any firearm from your collection. Whether you're testing a finely tuned sniper rifle or checking how a pistol works, the shooting range is the ultimate playground for gun lovers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/7012b05c5e71b3a132bd9d9253ee9f4e.poster.avif?t=1753731722\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/7012b05c5e71b3a132bd9d9253ee9f4e.webm?t=1753731722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/7012b05c5e71b3a132bd9d9253ee9f4e.mp4?t=1753731722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design and develop</h2>Your store is more than just a business \u2013 it\u2019s a reflection of your style and success. As you generate more revenue, reinvest it into expanding and improving your center. Designed store with organized gun racks, the d\u00e9cor will attract more traffic and increase your sales.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/05858cf3872aba7511a731eb665ee163.poster.avif?t=1753731722\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/05858cf3872aba7511a731eb665ee163.webm?t=1753731722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/05858cf3872aba7511a731eb665ee163.mp4?t=1753731722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Are you ready to become the best gun dealer? Whether you sell firearms to the public, cater to die-hard collectors, or test your skills on the shooting range, Gun Center Simulator is your ticket to success in the competitive world of the gun trade. Take on the role of an owner and experience the thrill of building a gun center empire!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/c9a6d211014b5d97e00864dc3e534331.poster.avif?t=1753731722\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/c9a6d211014b5d97e00864dc3e534331.webm?t=1753731722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618200/extras/c9a6d211014b5d97e00864dc3e534331.mp4?t=1753731722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
